                "3️⃣  Paste the line below → hit **Enter**\n"
                "4️⃣  The token appears — **copy the whole thing**\n\n"
                f"```\n{JS_SNIPPET}\n```\n\n"
                "Paste that token into Railway `MASSDM_BOT_TOKENS`"
